OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely cloudy skies on Monday
OL,6,Fwith a few outbreaks of rain or
OL,7,Fdrizzle possible at times. Becoming
OL,8,Fdrier and brighter during the
OL,9,Fafternoon feeling warm and humid in
OL,10,Fthe sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with clear spells,
OL,13,Fhowever cloud increasing from the
OL,14,Fnorth after midnight as a band of wind
OL,15,Fand rain arriving across Devon and
OL,16,FCornwall towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
