OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain sinking south across
OL,7,Fthe whole regions during the morning.
OL,8,FTurning drier and brighter into the
OL,9,Fafternoon with sunny spells and
OL,10,Fshowers.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FChangeable over the next few days and
OL,14,Ffeeling fresher. Sunshine and showers
OL,15,Fwill spread across the region, and it
OL,16,Fwill turn increasingly windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
